   "Vanguard Logistics satisfies the first justification set by maintaining 15 cargo aircraft against the 12 required, having a 98 percent customs accuracy rate versus 95 percent needed, recording 50000 metric tons of annual freight volume surpassing 40000, and holding an IATA Cargo Operator Certificate.",
